            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether a state could deem an arbitration clause unconscionable when it requires distant arbitration and costs the other party."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d330bae63973139a3d28594e6ff472e4eba3083f82204b76c5d45a363464bafd",
            "evidence_ids": [
