            "pages": {
              "end": 9,
              "start": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan inquired about Discover Bank\u2019s citation of the America Online case and its application to both arbitration and litigation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d330bae63973139a3d28594e6ff472e4eba3083f82204b76c5d45a363464bafd",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d330bae63973-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked how to distinguish facially neutral contract law defenses that implicitly discriminate against arbitration from those that do not."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d330bae63973139a3d28594e6ff472e4eba3083f82204b76c5d45a363464bafd",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d330bae63973-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked \u201cWhy, why, why?\u201d during the argument."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d330bae63973139a3d28594e6ff472e4eba3083f82204b76c5d45a363464bafd",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d330bae63973-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer later asked for the respondent\u2019s answer to the specific effort to assimilate the class\u2011action issue to a discrimination claim."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d330bae63973139a3d28594e6ff472e4eba3083f82204b76c5d45a363464bafd",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d330bae63973-0002-0004",
              "ev-d330bae63973-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked for clarification on a previous hypothetical question."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d330bae63973139a3d28594e6ff472e4eba3083f82204b76c5d45a363464bafd",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-d330bae63973-0002-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 49,
              "start": 49
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan questioned whether the test for state interference with arbitration is a purpose test or an effects test."
