              "pages": {
                "end": 27,
                "start": 26
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The respondents argue that the state law at issue is not preemptive because it aligns with the equal\u2011footing nondiscrimination principle recognized in Section\u202f2."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Respondents",
          "citations": [
